promptText.description:
Opens a single-line input panel. Use `args.initialValue` for prefilled text; `text` is the result field returned after confirmation and cannot be used as an input parameter. Static bindings and string functions evaluated in advance are allowed; client-side expressions and `maxLength` are not supported. Canceling does not write back a value. See ./examples/host-action.json for a complete message example.

Result schema:
```json
{
  "oneOf": [
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "status": {
          "const": "success"
        },
        "data": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "text": {
              "description": "Text entered by the user and returned after confirmation. This is a result field, not the input parameter for prefilled text.",
              "maxLength": 65536,
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "text"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "status",
        "data"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "status": {
          "const": "failed"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "status"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  ]
}
```

showConfirm.description:
Shows a confirmation dialog. The call is rejected when `message` is empty and `title` is omitted. Canceling returns `confirmed=false`.

Result schema:
```json
{
  "oneOf": [
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "status": {
          "const": "success"
        },
        "data": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "confirmed": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "confirmed"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "status",
        "data"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "status": {
          "const": "failed"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "status"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
